<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Physician Computer.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Physician Computer.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Piper Jaffray said it initiated coverage of Physician Computer Network Inc as a buy.</p>
<p>-- set a 12-month price target of $12 a share.</p>
<p>-- said expects Physician Computer to earn $0.28 a share in fiscal 1997.</p>
<p>-- Physician Computer gained 1/8 to 5-3/4.</p>
</text>
